<span class="line">  <span class="token tag"><span class="token tag"><span class="token punctuation">&lt;</span>my-button</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></span>Click me<span class="token tag"><span class="token tag"><span class="token punctuation">&lt;/</span>my-button</span><span class="token punctuation">&gt;</span></span></span>
